        "text": "Yes. Travelers looking for a Nagaon Beach resort with swimming pool often compare Dolphin House because it combines beach proximity, family rooms, and indoor pool access."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How close is Dolphin House to Nagaon Beach?",
